# Example requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Start first: make up. Interactive API docs: http://localhost:8001/docs
@base = http://localhost:8001/v1
@key = dev-key

### Upload a CSV (multipart). Columns: sku,name,price,currency,stock[,barcode]
POST {{base}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: feed-2026-10-22
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

sku,name,price,currency,stock
ABC-1,Çay Bardağı 6'lı,"129,90",TRY,40
ABC-2,Kahve Fincanı,not-a-price,TRY,10
ABC-3,Termos 1L,449.00,TRY,0
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="callback_url"

http://webhook-receiver:9000/hooks
--demo--

### Status and progress (replace the id)
GET {{base}}/imports/REPLACE-WITH-IMPORT-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Rejected rows with their line numbers
GET {{base}}/imports/REPLACE-WITH-IMPORT-ID/errors.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Cancel a running import
POST {{base}}/imports/REPLACE-WITH-IMPORT-ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Webhooks the demo receiver got (signature checked)
GET http://localhost:9000/received

### Make the receiver answer 503 to the next 2 deliveries
POST http://localhost:9000/control
Content-Type: application/json

{"fail": 2}
